      "message": "Run the offline commands on the command's own runtime\n\n`cairn admin export` and `cairn admin gc` each made a runtime of their\nown to drive git, inside a main that already is one, and a runtime\nrefuses to start inside another: the first graduation on the box died\nbefore writing a bundle. Both now await on the runtime main has, as\nthe other commands do. Rehearsed on a copy of the flagship: the\norganisation's bundles come out with every kind of ref, and a\ncollection runs.\n\nTwo races the mirror's slow runner found, both from the daily\ncollection the queue runs: deleting a repository removed its directory\nin place, and a collection started a moment earlier made that fail for\na deletion the forge had already recorded; the directory is now moved\naside at once and removed behind that. And the queue collected a\nrepository within seconds of a start, which on a test forge is every\nrepository at once; the first collection now waits ten minutes.\n\nChange-Id: Iruntime0111\nSigned-off-by: Mandip Adhikari <92096340+mandipadk@users.noreply.github.com>",
